        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n    U[Clienti Pondus&lt;br/&gt;Utenti autorizzati] --&gt; ALB[Application Load Balancer&lt;br/&gt;Ingresso HTTPS]\n\n    subgraph AWS[AWS Region]\n      direction TB\n\n      subgraph VPC[Amazon VPC&lt;br/&gt;Rete privata]\n        direction TB\n\n        subgraph AZ1[Availability Zone 1]\n          direction TB\n          subgraph WEB1[Subnet private applicative]\n            EC1[EC2 Windows primaria&lt;br/&gt;IIS + applicazione C#]\n          end\n        end\n\n        subgraph AZ2[Availability Zone 2]\n          direction TB\n          subgraph WEB2[Subnet private applicative]\n            EC2[EC2 Windows secondaria&lt;br/&gt;Solo se serve alta disponibilità]\n          end\n        end\n\n        subgraph DB[Subnet private database]\n          direction TB\n          RDS[Amazon RDS for SQL Server&lt;br/&gt;Single-AZ]\n        end\n\n        DMS[AWS Database Migration Service&lt;br/&gt;Migrazione iniziale + sincronizzazione]\n        SM[AWS Secrets Manager&lt;br/&gt;Credenziali database]\n        ACM[AWS Certificate Manager&lt;br/&gt;Certificato TLS]\n        SSM[AWS Systems Manager Session Manager&lt;br/&gt;Accesso amministrativo]\n        CW[Amazon CloudWatch&lt;br/&gt;Metriche, log e allarmi]\n        BCK[Backup&lt;br/&gt;Snapshot RDS e salvataggi]\n      end\n    end\n\n    ALB --&gt; EC1\n    ALB --&gt; EC2\n\n    EC1 --&gt; RDS\n    EC2 --&gt; RDS\n\n    DMS --&gt; RDS\n    SM --&gt; RDS\n    ACM --&gt; ALB\n    SSM --&gt; EC1\n    SSM --&gt; EC2\n    CW --&gt; EC1\n    CW --&gt; EC2\n    CW --&gt; RDS\n    BCK --&gt; RDS&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="EoIvJejxWMdbaEGZq3m7-1">
